stems will make defending your space station that much harder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175070/extras/b6127fde297ade286718b97d3f6231be.poster.avif?t=1771085881\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175070/extras/b6127fde297ade286718b97d3f6231be.webm?t=1771085881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175070/extras/b6127fde297ade286718b97d3f6231be.mp4?t=1771085881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Mentions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelikes in Space bundle artwork by digijelly on ArtStation.</p>",
